{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101110/extras/794c3182023480f2e3dd2a223239e327.poster.avif?t=1765629473\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101110/extras/794c3182023480f2e3dd2a223239e327.webm?t=1765629473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101110/extras/794c3182023480f2e3dd2a223239e327.mp4?t=1765629473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This indie precision platformer challenges players to climb 13 increasingly difficult levels filled with moving platforms, disappearing ledges, and unique mechanics that constantly keep you on your toes. Every level introduces new twists that test precision, timing, and adaptability, pushing your platforming skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter characters who share motivational messages that encourage persistence and self-improvement, adding an emotional layer to the intense gameplay. The main character moves with fluid, responsive controls designed to make every jump and recovery feel satisfying, even after countless falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just a climb, this journey is about resilience, frustration, and the thrill of overcoming seemingly impossible challenges, one platform at a time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101110?t=1765629473","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101110/2cd3a33cc7ea369cc55fe7975a1e506b0120047c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765629473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101110/4279a530fc296fcc9faf63d1656ac123fc1d50b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765629473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101110/4279a530fc296fcc9faf63d1656ac123fc1d50b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765629473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101110/extras/794c3182023480f2e3dd2a223239e327.poster.avif?t=1765629473\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101110/extras/794c3182023480f2e3dd2a223239e327.webm?t=1765629473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101110/extras/794c3182023480f2e3dd2a223239e327.mp4?t=1765629473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This indie precision platformer challenges players to climb 13 increasingly difficult levels filled with moving platforms, disappearing ledges, and unique mechanics that constantly keep you on your toes. Every level introduces new twists that test precision, timing, and adaptability, pushing your platforming skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter characters who share motivational messages that encourage persistence and self-improvement, adding an emotional layer to the intense gameplay. The main character moves with fluid, responsive controls designed to make every jump and recovery feel satisfying, even after countless falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just a climb, this journey is about resilience, frustration, and the thrill of overcoming seemingly impossible challenges, one platform at a time.</p>","developers":["Don't Be Scareed"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101110/036c5b83e3cbd28ff0ebc07ed7b799f5309da64c/header.jpg?t=1765629473","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4101110/1579505827/74522b46ad17b28a0bbd7a7194c7eb40492e52ac/1762216028/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762217104","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4101110/1579505827/74522b46ad17b28a0bbd7a7194c7eb40492e52ac/1762216028/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762217104","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4101110/1579505827/74522b46ad17b28a0bbd7a7194c7eb40492e52ac/1762216028/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762217104","id":257226424,"name":"B.O.B.Y's Journey","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257226424/75c9f557df1860e1a8c2b40f0ca2ab46e2cfbe8e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762217104"}],"name":"B.O.B.Y's Journey","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU (Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Designed to run on low-end hardware; may run on older laptops or netbooks.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>